<title>ESTONIA: SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN BUYS 10 PCT IN EMV.</title>
<headline>SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN BUYS 10 PCT IN EMV.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction company EMV said on Thursday that the Baltic Investment Fund had sold its ten percent stake in EMV to Svenska Handelsbanken.</p>
<p>Svenska Handelsbanken has together with its clients in Stockholm, London and New York 12 percent of EMV shares now, the company added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
